WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.120
SCP-173 Vs SCP-106. The Sinister,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:09.680
Neck-Snapping Sculpture Vs The Old Man&nbsp;
with the Plan to Torture You Forever.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.720
This is an incredibly close call, with&nbsp;
both being immensely powerful anomalies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.600
SCP-173 is one of the few&nbsp;
creatures SCP-682 is terrified of,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.880
and its ability to snap necks with little effort&nbsp;
and incredible speed make it a formidable foe.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.520
But 106 may just have the edge here.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.640
Firstly, we don’t even know if 106 has eyelids,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:35.120
so he might not ever blink. Secondly, his&nbsp;
powers make him able to phase through and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:41.440
also corrupt solid objects, which SCP-173 may&nbsp;
be vulnerable to. And most compelling of all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:46.640
there’s no telling what SCP-173 would make of&nbsp;
being trapped in the Old Man’s pocket dimension.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:51.440
For all these reasons, we think 106 would&nbsp;
walk away with the title belt this time!

